    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84121" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόδ-αργος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swift-footed,</i> or acc.
			to others <i>white-footed</i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδάργης:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκόπους,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				166
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πόδαργος</span></b> , ὁ, <u>Swiftfoot</u> or
				<i>Whitefoot,</i> a horse of Hector, also of Menelaus, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.185
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.295
			</span></i>; fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποδάργη,</span> name of a
			Harpy, <i><span class="en">
				16.150
			</span></i>.</div>
